  "question": {
    "text": "If the numbers appeared on the two throws of a fair six faced die are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math>, then the probability that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>, is",
    "image": null
  },
